> This patch adds support for SJA1000 based PCI CAN interface cards from 
> electronic system design gmbh.
> 
> The following list of boards are supported:
> 
> CAN-PCI/200 (tested)
> CAN-PCI/266
> CAN-PMC266
> CAN-PCIe/2000
> CAN-CPCI/200
